O3 is empty in row 3, and the neighbouring formulas in column O (O4 onward) follow a clear pattern, so I'm inferring O3 from them.

Rows 4–26 all use `=ABS(IFERROR((L4/$E4),0))`, so the row 3 version should be `=ABS(IFERROR((L3/$E3),0))`.

