The column G header is "Absolute Value of Purchase", and column F (Payment) already captures positive amounts. Purchases are the negative amounts in E, so G should show the absolute value of those negatives.

A likely formula is `=IF(E2<0,ABS(E2),"")`.

{"formula": "=IF(E2<0,ABS(E2),\"\")"}

The column header "Time Delta" in M1 and the existing N2 formula `=ABS(E2-K2)` (Cost Delta) suggest M2 should be the same calculation on the Time columns, D and J.

The Time values are text strings such as "Jan 5 2012 12:15:32.12", so the intended formula is most likely `=ABS(D2-J2)`.

